            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An expanded region of the vertebrate alimentary tract that serves as a food storage compartment and digestive organ. A stomach is lined, in whole or in part by a glandular epithelium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
