            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A fused bone consisting of the ilium, ischium and pubis. Together with the sacrum and coccyx, it comprises the pelvis. [WP,modified].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>currently this class is restricted to exclude the teleost bone as the definition mentions ilium, ischium and pubis. In future we may add a grouping class for girdle bones that supports the appendage</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <OboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>bone of pelvic girdle</OboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>innominate</OboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:16585</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>GAID:205</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:361776002</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
