        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>middle cuneiform bone of foot</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>os cuneiforme intermedium</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>os tarsale II</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>second cuneiform bone</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
