            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The flexor carpi ulnaris muscle (FCU) is a muscle of the human forearm that acts to flex and adduct the manus. [WP,unvetted].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:36198</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
