        <OboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>papilla mammaria</OboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Nipple being part_of mammary gland is due to a practical modelling in uberon that treats mammary gland as including adnexa. A GCI asserts that nipple is part of the breast in humans. For discussion of this, please refer to https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/1873.</rdfs:comment>
