        <obo:IAO_0000115>In humans: Muscles arising in the zygomatic arch that close the jaw. Their nerve supply is masseteric from the mandibular division of the trigeminal nerve. (From Stedman, 25th ed).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>we use this specifically for a jaw muscle that is innervates by the mandibular nerve.</obo:IAO_0000232>
