        <obo:IAO_0000115>Passages external to the liver for the conveyance of bile. These include the common bile duct and the common hepatic duct.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>includes all the cystic duct, all the common bile duct and the extrahapetic part of the hepatic duct</obo:IAO_0000116>
