        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Passages within the liver for the conveyance of bile. Includes right and left hepatic ducts even though these may join outside the liver to form the common hepatic duct.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>includes the hepatic duct of the caudate lobe, and the intra- and inter- lobar bile ducts</obo:IAO_0000116>
