            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The upper extremity of the humerus (proximal humerus) consists of a large rounded head joined to the body by a constricted portion called the neck, and two eminences, the greater and lesser tubercles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:23362</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:280028008</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
