        <obo:IAO_0000115>A sensory system that is capable of olfaction (the sensory perception of smell).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>consider splitting into main and accessory. See also: vomeronasal organ</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>we make the relationship to nervous system &apos;overlaps&apos;, as the olfactory system includes e.g. apertures in the cranium that are not part of the nervous system</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>AAO:0000334</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>AAO:0000978</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>BILA:0000144</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
