        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A process projection from a part of the vertebra such as centrum or arches. Examples: transverse process, diapophyses, parapophyses, and zygapophyses (both the cranial zygapophyses and the caudal zygapophyses).</obo:IAO_0000115>
