        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0011823"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Connective tissue that is dominated by collagen fibres organized into a definitive pattern (e.g., parallel to one another), with comparatively fewer cells (mostly fibroblasts).</obo:IAO_0000115>
