            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A segment of the pedal digit containing the distal phalanx. Note this class represents a digit segment and thus includes tissues in addition to bone.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>hindlimb digit tip</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
