        <OboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>muscle of pectoral girdle and wing</OboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>muscle of upper limb</OboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>upper limb muscle</OboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
