            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Anatomical cluster consisting of the skeletal elements (i.e. bone elements, cartilage elements, cartilage condensations) that are part of an individual subdivision of the organism. Excludes joints.</obo:IAO_0000115>
