        <tara:hasChineseLabel>手三里</tara:hasChineseLabel>
        <tara:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002386"/>
        <tara:hasIndicationsDescription>abdominal pain, diarrhea, toothache, swelling of the cheek, motor impairment of the upper limbs, pain in the shoulder and back.</tara:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <tara:hasInnervationDescription>The posterior antebrachial cutaneous nerve and the deep ramus of the radial nerve.</tara:hasInnervationDescription>
        <tara:hasLocationalDescription>On the posterolateral aspect of the forearm, on the line connecting LI5 with LI11, 2 B- cun inferior to the cubital crease.</tara:hasLocationalDescription>
