                    </owl:Restriction>
                </owl:someValuesFrom>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>[Acupoint Location, Pinyin Label, Chinese Label] WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization (WHO), WHO Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 211. https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/353407</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
        <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>[Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, Indications] Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Edited by C. Xinnong, Rev. Ed., Foreign Languages Press, Beijing, China, 1999. Ch. 10, Acupuncture Points of the Governor and the Conception Vessels and the Extra Points. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
        <tara:hasChineseLabel>風(风)府</tara:hasChineseLabel>
        <tara:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000974"/>
        <tara:hasIndicationsDescription>headache, neck rigidity, blurred vision, epistaxis, sore throat, post-apoplexy aphasia, hemiplegia, mental disorder.</tara:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <tara:hasInnervationDescription>The branches of the third cervical nerve and the great occipital nerve.</tara:hasInnervationDescription>
        <tara:hasLocationalDescription>In the posterior region of the neck, directly inferior to the external occipital protuberance, in the depression between the trapezius muscles. Note: With the head slightly extended in the seated position, loosen the trapezius muscle, then move superiorly from the midpoint of the posterior hairline to the occipital bone, gV16 will be found.</tara:hasLocationalDescription>
        <tara:hasMethodDescription>Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-0.8 inch. Deep puncture is not advisable. Medullary bulb is in the deep layer, special attention should be paid in acupuncture.</tara:hasMethodDescription>
        <tara:hasPinyinLabel>Fengfu</tara:hasPinyinLabel>
        <tara:hasSpecificSurfaceLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002380"/>
        <tara:hasSpecificSurfaceLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0013469"/>
        <tara:hasSynonym>Du 16</tara:hasSynonym>
        <tara:hasSynonym>Governor Vessel 16</tara:hasSynonym>
        <tara:hasSynonym>VG 16</tara:hasSynonym>
        <tara:isLocatedOnMeridian rdf:resource="http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_0386099"/>
        <rdfs:label>GV 16</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


