        <tara:hasInnervationDescription>The lateral branches of the posterior rami of the first and second sacral nerves.</tara:hasInnervationDescription>
        <tara:hasLocationalDescription>In the sacral region, at the same level as the second posterior sacral foramen, and 1.5 B-cun lateral to the median sacral crest. Note: At the same level as BL32.</tara:hasLocationalDescription>
        <tara:hasMethodDescription>Puncture perpendicularly 0.8-1.2 inches. Moxibustion is applicable.</tara:hasMethodDescription>
