        <tara:hasLocationalDescription>On the head, 5.5 B-cun superior to the posterior hairline, on the posterior median line. Note: GV19 is located 1.5 B-cun posterior to GV 20.</tara:hasLocationalDescription>
        <tara:hasMethodDescription>Puncture subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable. .</tara:hasMethodDescription>
