        <tara:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000033"/>
        <tara:hasIndicationsDescription>headache, redness and pain of the eye, failing of vision, lacrimation, deviation of the eye and mouth.</tara:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <tara:hasInnervationDescription>The zygomaticofacial and zygomaticotemporal nerve, the temporal branch of the facial nerve.</tara:hasInnervationDescription>
        <tara:hasLocationalDescription>On the head, in the depression, 0.5 B-cun lateral to the outer canthus of the eye.</tara:hasLocationalDescription>
        <tara:hasMethodDescription>Puncture subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 inch.</tara:hasMethodDescription>
