        <tara:hasInnervationDescription>The branches of the facial nerve. The point is right on the course of the infraorbital nerve.</tara:hasInnervationDescription>
        <tara:hasLocationalDescription>On the face, in the infraorbital foramen.</tara:hasLocationalDescription>
        <tara:hasMethodDescription>Puncture perpendicularly 0.2-0.3 inch. It is not advisable to puncture deeply.</tara:hasMethodDescription>
