        <tara:hasInnervationDescription>The lateral antebrachial cutaneous nerve and the superficial branch of the radial nerve.</tara:hasInnervationDescription>
        <tara:hasLocationalDescription>On the anterolateral aspect of the forearm, between the radial styloid process and the radial artery, 1 B-cun superior to the palmar wrist crease. Note: 1 B-cun superior to LU9.</tara:hasLocationalDescription>
        <tara:hasMethodDescription>Puncture perpendicularly 0.1-0.3 inch. Avoid puncturing the radial artery.</tara:hasMethodDescription>
        <tara:hasPinyinLabel>Jingqu</tara:hasPinyinLabel>
