        <tara:hasChineseLabel>次髎(髎)</tara:hasChineseLabel>
        <tara:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0005473"/>
        <tara:hasIndicationsDescription>low back pain, hernia, irregular menstruation, leukorrhea, dysmenorrhea, nocturnal emission, impotence, enuresis, dysuria, muscular atrophy, pain, numbness and motor impairment of the lower extremities.</tara:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <tara:hasInnervationDescription>The posterior ramus of the second sacral nerve.</tara:hasInnervationDescription>
        <tara:hasLocationalDescription>In the sacral region, in the second posterior sacral foramen. Note: The second posterior sacral foramen is located in the depression, midway be- tween the posterior superior iliac spine and the spinous process of the second sacral vertebra.</tara:hasLocationalDescription>
        <tara:hasMethodDescription>Puncture perpendicularly 0.8-1.2 inches. Moxibustion is applicable.</tara:hasMethodDescription>
        <tara:hasPinyinLabel>Chiliao</tara:hasPinyinLabel>
