        <tara:hasIndicationsDescription>fullness and pain in the chest and hypochondriac region.</tara:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <tara:hasInnervationDescription>The lateral cutaneous branch of the third intercostal nerve.</tara:hasInnervationDescription>
        <tara:hasLocationalDescription>In the anterior thoracic region, in the third intercostal space, 6 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line. Note: SP19, ST6 and KI24 are located along the curve of the third intercostal space.</tara:hasLocationalDescription>
        <tara:hasMethodDescription>Puncture obliquely 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable.</tara:hasMethodDescription>
