        <tara:hasInnervationDescription>The medial branch of the posterior ramus of the tenth thoracic nerve.</tara:hasInnervationDescription>
        <tara:hasLocationalDescription>In the upper back region, in the depression inferior to the spinous process of the tenth thoracic vertebra (T10), on the posterior median line.</tara:hasLocationalDescription>
